  "id": "red-beans-and-rice-with-sausage",
  "name": "Red Beans and Rice with Sausage",
  "subtitle": "Slow-cooked beans served over hot rice",
  "description": "Tender red beans are seasoned with aromatics and spices, cooked with ham hock, finished with smoked sausage, and served over rice.",
